7a. Third-party font asset BUNDLED in this candidate
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
One third-party font asset is distributed in this candidate. It is listed
here, not in §7, because §7 is the quarantine list of assets that are
never distributed.

  - Inter Tight 600 (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
    - Upstream: https://github.com/google/fonts (Inter Tight,
      "Copyright 2022 The Inter Project Authors")
    - Pinned commit: fac60545cc0de9d4eff6eb5b1ab88bcdfc9ecc69
    - Upstream source SHA-256: recorded in
      docs/brand/wordmark-inter-tight-600.json (upstreamTtfSha256)
    - License: SIL Open Font License 1.1. The upstream copyright notice
      specifies NO Reserved Font Name, so OFL clause 3 does not restrict
      naming; the bundled webfont is still distributed under the distinct
      family name "Inter Tight Skilit" so a modified subset is not
      presented as the upstream family.
    - Bundled paths:
        apps/web/public/brand/inter-tight-latin-600.woff2  (reduced basic
          Latin WOFF2 subset; SHA-256 in the same JSON, subsetSha256)
        docs/brand/wordmark-inter-tight-600.json  (wordmark outline
          geometry converted from the font; an OFL Modified Version)
        docs/brand/licenses/Inter-Tight-OFL.txt  (the OFL 1.1 text and
          the upstream copyright notice)
    - Why it is compliant: OFL 1.1 condition 2 permits bundling a
      Modified Version provided each copy contains the copyright notice
      and the license; condition 5 requires the Modified Version to stay
      under this license. The OFL text and the copyright notice are
      distributed in this tree, the subset and the outlines are recorded
      as OFL-governed derivatives, and no upstream file is modified in
      place.
    - Rights scope: source and assets are license-governed; trademarks
      are restricted (§10) and the font name is used descriptively only.
      No endorsement is claimed or implied.
    - Provenance record: UPSTREAMS.lock.yml, id
      inter-tight-google-fonts (status: imported).

